		{
			"id": "5daca328e87e634c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- NOR flash \n\t\t\n\t- 隨機讀寫一個 word\n\t\t\n\t- 用在 embedded system 當作 instr. memory\n\t\n- NAND flase\n\t\t\n\t- 一次存取一個 block",
			"x": 210,
			"y": -42,
			"width": 410,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "2c0309587868bd38",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 寫太多次會壞所以沒有辦法取代硬碟\n- 所以使用交換位置去寫入，常用的換到不常用這樣",
			"x": 210,
			"y": 205,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 91,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "59d275044806132c",
